TI  - Progress with electronic health record adoption among emergency and outpatient 
      departments: United States, 2006-2011.
PG  - 1-8
AB  - The Health Information Technology for Economic and Clinical Health (HITECH) Act 
      of 2009 provides incentive payments to eligible hospitals and providers that 
      demonstrate the meaningful use of a certified electronic health record (EHR) 
      system . This report describes the adoption of EHRs in hospital emergency 
      departments (EDs) and outpatient departments (OPDs) from 2006 through 2011 using 
      the National Hospital Ambulatory Medical Care Survey (NHAMCS).
