      Adoption: DataWell in Greater Manchester.
PG  - 790-794
AB  - Several high profile, problematic UK health data-sharing projects have shaped NHS 
      professionals' and the public's opinion about NHS data-sharing projects, and 
      there is a substantial body of evidence identifying barriers to Health 
      Information Exchange (HIE) adoption. Socio-technical factors are a significant 
      consideration and this paper describes the approach taken to address these 
      concerns in the design and implementation of a HIE for Greater Manchester.
