TI  - Cultural Problems Associated with the Implementation of eHealth.
PG  - 1213
AB  - A major hurdle in eHealth implementation is that it is difficult to put into 
      practice. In this study, the primary aim was to identify the main barrier 
      associated with implementing eHealth. This study surveyed IMIA members from May 
      to November 2015. From the results, it is clear that medical professionals were 
      recording most of their data by hand. This paper culture is a paradigm that is 
      difficult to break. Cultural factors are the primary barrier in eHealth 
      implementation.
