TI  - Using Principles of Agile Leadership in a Frontier Hospital Electronic Health 
      Record System Implementation.
PG  - 16-21
LID - 10.1097/HAP.0000000000000184 [doi]
AB  - The challenge of implementing a new electronic health record system in any 
      hospital can be daunting. Doing so in a small frontier hospital with limited 
      resources can be monumental. By incorporating fundamental leadership principles, 
      including Agile leadership principles and committing to a set of values, Lincoln 
      Health in Hugo, Colorado, achieved a successful implementation on an accelerated 
      schedule.
