TI  - Characterization of Help Desk issues After the Implementation of an Emergency 
      Department Electronic Health Record.
PG  - 875
AB  - Electronic health records (EHRs) can produce significant disruption when first 
      implemented. Successful implementations depend on the availability of technical 
      and clinical support. We present a description of the frequency and types of 
      issues raised during the first 12 months after the implementation of an EHR at a 
      teaching hospital in Santiago, Chile.
