TI  - Digital health literacy as a super determinant of health: More than simply the 
      sum of its parts.
PG  - 100500
LID - 10.1016/j.invent.2022.100500 [doi]
LID - 100500
AB  - •Civic literacy refers to the ability to engage meaningfully with one's 
      community.•Digital, health, and civic literacy are key predictors for digital 
      health literacy.•The extent to which these three affect digital health literacy 
      remains unclear.•Building digital health literacy is vital to limit inequalities 
      from expanding.
