      Martina Heßbrügge, Lucas Küppers, Larisa Pilic, Marcus Redaèlli, Lara Schneider, 
      Frank Vitinius, Stefan Wilm, Uwe Konerding. Originally published in the Journal 
      of Medical Internet Research (https://www.jmir.org).
